OL,3,GNEWSAShadow council signs off on junior
OL,4,Aschool move
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to move a Surrey school away from
OL,7,Fits current premises have been given
OL,8,Fthe green light by councillors.
OL,10,FA planned relocation of Reigate Priory
OL,11,FJunior School to new purpose-built
OL,12,Ffacilities at Woodhatch Place, Cockshot
OL,13,FHill was brought before East Surrey's
OL,14,Fshadow cabinet this week.
OL,16,FThe shadow council, which will be
OL,17,Fresponsible for East Surrey's schools
OL,18,Ffrom April, was asked to authorise the
OL,19,Fmove following the same decision
OL,20,Fpreviously by Surrey County Council.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
