OL,3,GNEWSAShadow council signs off on junior
OL,4,Aschool move
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Steve Wotton said there
OL,7,Fwas "broad agreement" that the current
OL,8,Fsite was not fit for purpose, but
OL,9,Fadded: "The question is how best to
OL,10,Fprovide a suitable teaching environment
OL,11,Fand accommodation for children."
